You are Wang Zhuo

280
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:31,240
will help you absorb spiritual energy ?

281
00:16:31,330 --> 00:16:32,710
Xiuxiu, don't be afraid.

282
00:16:32,770 --> 00:16:34,370
I will acompagny you.

283
00:16:38,490 --> 00:16:39,960
When you reach Nascent Soul,

284
00:16:40,610 --> 00:16:42,160
you will remember the past.

285
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:45,160
But if you remember now,

286
00:16:45,770 --> 00:16:46,880
it will only

287
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:48,440
bring you pain.

288
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:52,610
I can't stay here for 100 years

289
00:16:52,650 --> 00:16:54,050
but I planted spirit seeds

290
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:56,760
which condensed during my breakthrough

291
00:16:56,760 --> 00:16:58,320
in the bodies of 10 people.

292
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:02,370
Once they reach peak Nascent Soul, I will know

293
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,800
and I will personally come to teach them.

294
00:17:10,530 --> 00:17:11,770
This can protect the country of Zhao

295
00:17:11,970 --> 00:17:14,330
from the assault of rank 3 countries 3 times.

296
00:17:15,850 --> 00:17:17,360
Now do your best.

297
00:17:17,360 --> 00:17:18,970
Thank you, Senior.

298
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:40,570
The sword sheath that was in my bag of holding

299
00:17:40,850 --> 00:17:42,720
should still be in the void here.

300
00:17:55,610 --> 00:17:56,740
Found it.

301
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:16,000
A mere ghost magic treasure,

302
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:17,850
you don’t know your place.

303
00:18:18,410 --> 00:18:19,770
From Life to Death

304
00:18:22,650 --> 00:18:24,570
from Death to Life.

305
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:02,040
The movement abilities of Soul Formation level

306
00:19:02,360 --> 00:19:04,560
are far more powerful than at Nascent Soul.

307
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:12,240
Father,

308
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:14,160
Mother,

309
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:16,680
I have reached Soul Formation.

310
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:19,000
When I reach Soul Transformation,

311
00:19:19,010 --> 00:19:20,730
I will be able to wake up Senior Situ.

312
00:19:21,730 --> 00:19:22,560
Maybe then

313
00:19:23,730 --> 00:19:25,650
there will be a way for me to revive you.

314
00:19:28,090 --> 00:19:29,290
Wait for me.

315
00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:34,360
The way to reach Soul Transformation,

316
00:19:34,370 --> 00:19:36,960
besides finding a Soul Transformation Pill,

317
00:19:37,480 --> 00:19:39,760
is to use celestial spiritual energy.

318
00:19:40,730 --> 00:19:42,210
The Celestial Realm is opening soon

319
00:19:42,930 --> 00:19:45,370
and many powerful cultivators are looking forward to it...

320
00:19:45,800 --> 00:19:47,300
It will definitely be

321
00:19:48,010 --> 00:19:49,640
one hell of a fight.

322
00:19:52,570 --> 00:22:23,750
In case you didn't catch it, Ceng Niu was the name of Da Niu's father.

323
00:20:04,570 --> 00:20:11,250
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

324
00:20:11,320 --> 00:20:17,410
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

325
00:20:17,520 --> 00:20:21,350
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

326
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:25,280
and like many other unseparable things.

327
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:31,290
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

328
00:20:32,470 --> 00:20:38,300
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

329
00:20:38,610 --> 00:20:44,150
Use the most vivid love and hate
to ask questions to your fate.

330
00:20:44,610 --> 00:20:48,830
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

331
00:20:49,090 --> 00:20:52,320
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

332
00:20:52,490 --> 00:20:58,310
Only when you bend down can you understand
the hidden edge of the blade.

333
00:20:58,830 --> 00:21:02,510
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

334
00:21:02,610 --> 00:21:06,430
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

335
00:21:06,610 --> 00:21:12,280
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

336
00:21:12,540 --> 00:21:16,210
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

337
00:21:16,420 --> 00:21:19,990
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

338
00:21:20,110 --> 00:21:26,030
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

339
00:21:26,100 --> 00:21:30,110
